{"a":[27,29],"h":"<p>27.<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"118\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 117.6 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 23.3 31.4 38.3 38.3 54.0 60.7 67.4 67.4 74.3 81.0 81.0 87.7 94.4\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"23.3 60.7 74.3 87.7 94.4 101.3\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> bu suretle o Arzda bitirmekteyiz<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"58\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 58.3 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 16.4 16.4 23.3 23.3 30.0\" y=\"26.3 26.3 26.3 21.0 26.3 26.3 26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"30.0 42.0\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> hububat 28.<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"70\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 70.3 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 23.3 23.3 30.0 36.8 36.8 45.8\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"30.0 45.8 54.0\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> ve ma'lûm üzüm - ki Arzın sürülüşünde hububatın ve bağların tımarında insanların mesa'ilerinin de bir kıymeti olmakla beraber o kara toprakta böyle daneler üzümler yetiştirecek derecede feyz-u tekâmül uyandıran hep Allah tealâdır. <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"76\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 75.6 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 23.3 23.3 23.3 30.0 30.0 44.3 51.0\" y=\"26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 21.0 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"44.3 51.0 59.3\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> Tâze yonca - veya sebze 29.<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"133\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 133.3 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 21.7 28.6 28.6 41.3 48.0 65.3 72.0 72.0 78.7 87.0 87.0 93.7 93.7 100.6 108.7\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"41.3 48.0 100.6 108.7 117.0\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> - ma'lûm 30. </p>"}